                <pb facs="0198" n="124" sameAs="frus:frus1866p2/pg124"/>

                <head>[Enclosure H.—Telegram.]</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Presented the 16th, 1866, 4.30 o’clock; received
                        the 16th, 1866. 8.25 o’clock.]</seg></opener>
                <p>
                    <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rome</hi>.</placeName></p>
                <p>His Excellency Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Marsh,</hi>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">American Minister, Florence :</hi></p>
                <p>I have just heard that Surratt has been admitted, wounded, into the hospital at
                    Sora.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>RUFUS KING.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
